message: If you use this portal, please cite it as below.
title: "Earning, learning and training: young people, work, learning and training across the UK"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Silva
    given-names: Emanuel
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5880-7219
repository-code: https://github.com/cyberdudeuk/earning-learning-training
url: https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/earning-learning-training/
abstract: >-
  An evidence-led portal for young people aged 16 to 24 who are not in work, learning or training, and everyone
  around them: the Milburn Review, every UK government strategy, programme, duty and target that bears on it, routes
  into work, learning, training and self-employment, and the records that follow a young person, with every claim
  traced to its source. A prototype, not an official government service.
keywords: [NEET, young people, Milburn Review, employment, education, training, UK government]
